# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:7
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_c68592bb:

    # MC "Markus!"
    MC "マルクス!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:8
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_f3542d5e:

    # MC "Run! RUN!"
    MC "走れ!走れ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:9
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_e144dd44:

    # "We sprinted down deeper into the darkness of the unknown, the sounds of metal clanking, beasts snarling, and cries of agony followed behind us."
    "我々は未知の闇へと更に駆け下りた、金属の軋む音、獣の唸り声、そして苦痛の叫びが後を追ってきた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:11
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_265a452b:

    # MARKUS "They’re gaining on us!"
    MARKUS "まずい、追いつかれる!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:12
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_bc178804:

    # MC "Keep running! Don’t stop!"
    MC "走り続けろ!止まるな!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:13
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_891fbb8d:

    # MARKUS "But... {b}{i}the others!{/i}{/b}"
    MARKUS "でも…{b}{i}他のみんなは!{/i}{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:14
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_db8ca703:

    # MC "There’s nothing we can do! We have to get to—"
    MC "どうしようもない! 逃げるしか——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:18
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_3f5de290:

    # MARKUS "L-Look at it!"
    MARKUS "L-Look、見てよッ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:19
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_91c3f48f:

    # MC "Markus! Draw your sword, damn it!"
    MC "マーカス!剣を抜け、この野郎!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:20
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_a1ddd20f:

    # "Unsheathing his blade with trembling hands, Markus fumbled and dropped it to the floor with a loud clank."
    "震える手で刃を抜き、マーカスはそれを取り落とし、ガチャリと音を立てて床に落とした。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:21
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_a8f4e15d:

    # MARKUS "Sh-Shit!"
    MARKUS "ち、ちくしょう!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:22
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_aa4f252c:

    # MC "MARKUS!"
    MC "マーカス!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:23
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_80342e3b:

    # "The beast charges at Markus, but is suddenly attacked by one of the soldiers fighting the demonic creatures throughout the caves."
    "獣がマーカスに突進するが、突然、洞窟内で魔物と戦う兵士の一人に攻撃される。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:26
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_207c971f:

    # SCOUT "Go! GO NOW!"
    SCOUT "行け!今すぐ行け!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:27
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_9fcbf27a:

    # MC "Markus, quickly!"
    MC "マルクス、早く!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:28
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_6f2ce96a:

    # MARKUS "Right!"
    MARKUS "そうだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:29
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_71f2a840:

    # "Darting around the battle, we managed to burst our way through into the Forbidden Chamber."
    "戦いの中を駆け抜け、我々は何とか禁域へと突入した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:30
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_f45bd3a6:

    # MC "Seal the door! SEAL THE FUCKING DOOR!"
    MC "扉を閉鎖しろ!　くそったれの扉を閉鎖しろ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:31
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_473f4bcc:

    # MARKUS "But he—"
    MARKUS "しかし彼は—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:32
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_b8303e9d:

    # MC "DO IT!"
    MC "やれ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:34
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_045294e7:

    # "As Markus moved to try and activate the seal by pulling the strange mechanical levers to our left, I looked up through the deep, seemingly endless darkness of the catacombs."
    "マルカスが左側にある奇妙な機械仕掛けのレバーを引いて封印を作動させようとしたとき、わたしは地下墓地の深く果てしなく暗い闇を見上げていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:35
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_ddae734c:

    # "I watched as the monstrosity before me took a hold of the Scout with both of its colossal, wretched, claw like hands and held the flailing man out."
    "目の前の化け物が、巨大で不気味な鉤爪のような両手で偵察兵を掴み、もがく男を押し出しながら持ち上げた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:36
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_cc7a069b:

    # "His cloak flapped helplessly as he swung desperately at the beast, retching up blood, unable to break free from its deathly grip."
    "彼のマントは無様にはためき、獣に向かって必死に振るわれたが、血を吐きながらも、その死の掴みから逃れることはできなかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:37
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_fa086f51:

    # "The creature relished the moment, feverishly lapping up his blood, snarling in sick pleasure as the Scout croakily managed to cry out."
    "その異形は瞬間を味わい、貪るように彼の血を舐め上げ、斥候がかすれた声で叫びを上げる中、病んだ喜びに唸った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:38
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_7337b94e:

    # SCOUT "FUCK YOU!"
    SCOUT "くたばれ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:39
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_bb463d92:

    # SCOUT "I HOPE YOU FUCKING CHO—"
    SCOUT "クソったれが選——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:40
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_b3d4450b:

    # "We watched in horror as the beast twisted the body of the man, his cries of pain contorting into an animal like squeal."
    "我々は恐怖に凍りつき、その獣が男の身体を捩じ曲げるのを見ていた。苦痛の叫びは、やがて動物のような金切り声へと変じていった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:42
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_2675f8e6:

    # "What followed was a terrible snapping as he tore the body in two, flinging the man’s halves aside."
    "次に起こったのは、彼がその体を真っ二つに引き裂く恐ろしいバキッという音だった。男の両半身を放り投げながら。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:43
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_81cfc0fe:

    # "Behind it, barely visible was a myriad of other monsters, clawing and clambering their way down towards us."
    "その背後には、無数の他の怪物たちがかすかに見え、爪を立ててよじ登りながら、我々の方へと降りてくる。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:44
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_ddba1310:

    # MC "Markus... hurry."
    MC "マルクス…急いで。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:45
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_463d4592:

    # "The beast roared and charged at us once again! A behemoth of tooth and claw, galloping, ready."
    "獣は再び咆哮し、我々に突進してきた!牙と爪のベヒーモスが、駆け足で、準備万端で。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:47
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_4170c645:

    # MC "HURRY!"
    MC "急げ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:48
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_7ad62c8c:

    # MARKUS "It won’t close!"
    MARKUS "閉まらない!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:49
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_d7589ccf:

    # MC "CLOSE IT! CLOSE THE FUCKING DOOR!"
    MC "閉めろ! くそったれの扉を閉めろ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:51
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_ef27cd89:

    # MARKUS "I’m trying!"
    MARKUS "やってるってば!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:52
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_2cd10d35:

    # MC "MARKUS! HURRY! IT’S NEARLY—"
    MC "MARKUS!急いで!もうすぐ——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:70
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_135591ef:

    # MC "Ah... Today’s the day... {i}Terminus Ceremony.{/i}"
    MC "ああ…今日はその日だ…{i}ターミナス・セレモニー{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:71
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_3b92041f:

    # "Rising from my bed, I was hit by a {i}shockwave{/i}."
    "ベッドから起き上がると、{i}衝撃波{/i}が私を襲った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:72
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_7ae716df:

    # MC "Urgh... {i}My head...{/i}"
    MC "うぐっ…{i}頭が…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:73
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_b98a473f:

    # MC "Why did I let Markus talk me into drinking so much last night?"
    MC "なぜ私は昨夜、マーカスに説得されてあんなに飲んでしまったのだろう？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:74
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_47517399:

    # MC "Well, better get ready."
    MC "さて、準備しなくちゃね。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:75
translate ja qst_Terminus_intro_19314b42:

    # MC "I should grab some gold before I head out, it is {i}a ceremony{/i} after all."
    MC "出かける前に、金貨をいくらか持っていくべきだ、{i}儀式{/i}なんだから。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:81
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_d39399b8:

    # "Hm... Where is everyone?"
    "うーん…みんなどこだろう？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:82
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_232c2f5f:

    # "Looks like Regina is in her room."
    "レジーナは部屋にいるようだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:83
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_4ce9008c:

    # "...Should I?"
    "……しようか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:85
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_7aa86cfe:

    # MC "...Should I?" nointeract
    MC "…しようかな。" nointeract

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:91
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_8060ab4f:

    # MC "I... I shouldn’t watch this! This is... {i}perverse{/i}."
    MC "私…　こんなの見ちゃダメだ!　これは……{i}いかがわしい{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:92
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_a8c437e9:

    # MC "... But she does look {i}really{/i} pretty."
    MC "…でも彼女は{i}本当に{/i}きれいだな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:98
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_2403981d:

    # MC "No, of course I’m not gonna do that! What the hell am I even thinking?"
    MC "いや、もちろんそんなことするわけないだろ!何考えてんだ、俺は!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:105
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_3525008c:

    # "Following the death of both Erika’s mother and my own due to winter fever, our fathers were sent to the front."
    "エリカの母も、私の母も冬熱で亡くなり、二人の父親は戦地へ送られた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:106
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_42b425f3:

    # "Regina, a friend to both families agreed to look after us till our respective fathers came home from the war."
    "レジーナ、両家の友人である彼女が、それぞれの父親が戦争から帰ってくるまで、私たちの面倒を見てくれることになった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:108
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_feb83ee4:

    # MC "Erika! I wasn’t expecting you to be here today!"
    MC "えりか!今日ここにいるなんて思わなかったよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:109
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_6f2e862b:

    # MC "Aren’t you supposed to be on top secret Inquisitor work?"
    MC "極秘の審問官の仕事をしているんじゃないのか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:110
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_c8360b21:

    # ERIKA @ talk "I couldn’t miss seeing you on your big day."
    ERIKA @ talk "君の大切な日を見逃すわけにはいかないよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:111
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_91f2bc0b:

    # MC "You didn’t need to come but it means the world to me that you have."
    MC "あえて来る必要なんてなかったけど…本当に嬉しいよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:112
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_650e053a:

    # "Erika, thanks to her outstanding grades and increasing aptitude for magic, was snatched up and positioned with the Inquisitors on her final schooling day."
    "エリカは、卓越した成績と増し続ける魔法の適性のおかげで、最終学歴の日に異端審問官たちに引き抜かれた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:113
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_f0e4df88:

    # "I must admit, I missed her deeply as she went off, gallivanting around on great adventures..."
    "私は認めなければならない、彼女のことが恋しかったと
大冒険に出かける彼女の姿を見送りながら…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:114
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_41ebf0a9:

    # "But I knew the work she did was particularly important, so I was always proud of her."
    "でも彼女の仕事は特に重要なものだと知っていたから、いつも誇りに思っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:121
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_3dc6f6d9:

    # REGINA @ shock_talk "Erika!"
    REGINA @ shock_talk "エリカ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:123
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_c6e8ca81:

    # REGINA @ smile_talk "Oooh! Come here, my love!"
    REGINA @ smile_talk "おおっ!こちらへ、我が愛しき人よ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:130
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_83439c50:

    # ERIKA @ surp_talk "Can’t... {i}breathe!{/i}"
    ERIKA @ surp_talk "息が…{i}苦しい!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:131
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_5b0fac1a:

    # REGINA @ shy_talk "Oh! Sorry, dear!"
    REGINA @ shy_talk "あっ!ごめんね、あなた!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:134
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_f5edd23e:

    # REGINA @ smile_talk "I can’t believe you’re already eighteen."
    REGINA @ smile_talk "もう十八歳だなんて信じられない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:135
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_88b2e62e:

    # REGINA @ smile_talk "Your father would be so proud!"
    REGINA @ smile_talk "お父さん、きっと誇りに思うでしょう!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:137
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_e0dadf01:

    # MC "... Is there any news on Father?"
    MC "…父について、何かニュースはありますか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:139
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_b8e7f843:

    # REGINA @ talk "... Well..."
    REGINA @ talk "……ええと…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:141
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_8bbedfc6:

    # REGINA @ sad_talk "No, but..."
    REGINA @ sad_talk "いや、でも…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:142
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_aa290b42:

    # MC sad "..."
    MC sad "……"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:144
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_76751a70:

    # ERIKA @ talk "I’m sure he’s fine, he’s been sent to help with the negotiations with Lord Psydon."
    ERIKA @ talk "きっと無事だ、サイドン様との交渉の手伝いに送られたから。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:146
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_ccbfcfda:

    # MC "That was six months ago."
    MC "それは半年前のことだった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:147
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_4b917138:

    # ERIKA @ talk "Yes, but you know how these things are..."
    ERIKA @ talk "ええ、でも…こういうことって…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:148
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_528993a6:

    # ERIKA @ talk "The travel alone can take weeks, even months sometimes."
    ERIKA @ talk "移動だけでも数週間、時には数ヶ月かかることもある。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:149
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_d7fb3292:

    # MC "Has he sent any letters at least?"
    MC "少なくとも手紙ぐらいは送ってきたりしてるか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:150
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_9f665cf0:

    # REGINA @ talk "No, the last I received was him letting us know he was safe and that the men in his company were in good spirits."
    REGINA @ talk "いや、最後に連絡があったのは、無事なのと部隊の士気は高いとだけだった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:151
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_ef3818f6:

    # REGINA @ talk "I’m sure he will write to us as soon as he can."
    REGINA @ talk "きっと、できるだけ早く手紙をくれると思います。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:152
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_9130bb88:

    # MC @ sad "{i}*Sigh*{/i}... I hope he’s okay."
    MC @ sad "{i}はあ…{/i}…あの子、無事だといいんだけど。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:153
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_e035c6b1:

    # MC @ sad "And I wish he was here."
    MC @ sad "彼がここにいてくれたらなあ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:155
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_be4f1677:

    # REGINA @ talk "We all do, my love..."
    REGINA @ talk "私たち皆そうです、愛しい人..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:156
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_54c9401a:

    # REGINA @ smile_talk "But come now! Today’s a big day!"
    REGINA @ smile_talk "さあさあ!今日は大事な日ですよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:159
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_f60e5636:

    # ERIKA @ smile_talk "Today, you have the glorious honour of scrubbing the outhouses clean!"
    ERIKA @ smile_talk "本日、貴方は光栄なる名誉をもって、便所を磨き清める役目を授かりました!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:160
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_ef69be91:

    # MC @ smile "... Ha-ha, how funny you are."
    MC @ smile "…はは、おもしろい人ね。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:162
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_5bc91582:

    # REGINA @ smile_talk "Both he and Markus have been working tirelessly on their studies for months."
    REGINA @ smile_talk "彼とマルクスは、数ヶ月間休まずに勉学に励んできた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:163
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_15991414:

    # ERIKA @ smile_talk "Glad to hear it, and here I was worried you’d both spend too much time chasing girls."
    ERIKA @ smile_talk "それは良かった、君たち二人が女の子を追い回すのに時間を費やしすぎるかと心配していたんだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:164
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_27ffcbae:

    # MC @ smile "And risk our great chance at the palace?"
    MC @ smile "宮殿での千載一遇のチャンスを危険にさらすのか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:165
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_8d17beaa:

    # ERIKA @ lewd_talk "Ah yes, I forgot, you want to chase beautiful AND rich girls."
    ERIKA @ lewd_talk "ああ、忘れてた、君は美人かつお金持ちな女の子を狙ってるんだったね。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:166
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_28eda718:

    # MC "I’m a man with reputable tastes, Erika."
    MC "私は洗練された趣味を持つ男だよ、エリカ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:167
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_41eb3cb0:

    # ERIKA @ smile_talk "Tastes well above your station, I might add."
    ERIKA @ smile_talk "ご身分に不相応な味、と言っておくわ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:168
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_3f3dc3f8:

    # REGINA "So, I take it you’re both still planning on being administrators in the Royal Court, isn’t that right?"
    REGINA "それでは、お二人とも引き続き宮廷の役人を目指していらっしゃるんですね？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:172
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_b61df758:

    # ERIKA @ smile_talk "Hoping for a nice easy life, huh?"
    ERIKA @ smile_talk "楽で気楽な人生を願ってるんだね？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:173
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_7434d5e2:

    # REGINA @ talk "Oh stop, Erika! Him and every other student is hoping to be designated a nicer role like that."
    REGINA @ talk "ちょっとエリカ!彼も他の生徒たちも皆、その方がいい役柄に任命されるのを期待しているんだから。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:174
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_2a39ea4a:

    # ERIKA @ talk "Most of them are also daydreaming about sleeping with the Princess."
    ERIKA @ talk "彼らの大半も、姫と寝ることを夢想している。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:175
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_f192bed0:

    # REGINA @ shock_talk "Erika! Your mouth, young lady!"
    REGINA @ shock_talk "エリカ!その口の利き方、お嬢様!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:178
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_e7b4bc47:

    # REGINA @ talk "Y-You’re joking, right?"
    REGINA @ talk "マ、まさか冗談でしょ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:179
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_cba23fe7:

    # ERIKA @ smile_talk "Finally! A job I think you two pervs would actually be good at!"
    ERIKA @ smile_talk "やっとだ!お前ら変態には向いてる仕事だと思うよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:181
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_662ec96d:

    # REGINA @ lewd_talk "AHEM! I hope that wasn’t a {i}serious{/i} suggestion, I don’t know I’d be able to live with the embarrassment of having to explain your new role to people."
    REGINA @ lewd_talk "あのさ!それは{i}真剣な提案{/i}じゃないよね？人にあなたの新しい役割を説明しなきゃいけないなんて、恥ずかしくて生きていけないよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:182
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_ac18dfc3:

    # MC "Yes, I’m only playing."
    MC "冗談だよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:183
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_6c06afb5:

    # REGINA @ talk "I should hope so too!"
    REGINA @ talk "そう願いたいね!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:184
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_07d7d654:

    # REGINA @ talk "You’ve both worked far too hard and are far too bright for that kind of work."
    REGINA @ talk "二人とも、そんな仕事をするにはあまりにも必死に働きすぎているし、あまりにも聡明すぎるのです。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:186
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_71b3d9fe:

    # REGINA "... Well, that’s odd, it’s all the two of you have talked about for the last few years!"
    REGINA "……変だな、ここ数年二人きりで話してきたのはそればっかりだったのに!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:187
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_b6d9af33:

    # ERIKA "Yeah, why the sudden change of heart? Realised there’s no way in hell you’d be able to woo the Princess, huh?"
    ERIKA "ああ、急にどうした？どう転んでも王女様に言い寄れないと悟ったか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:188
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_a8b0989d:

    # MC "Cute."
    MC "可愛い。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:189
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_8e4eb0b8:

    # MC "And I dunno, I guess..."
    MC "で、なんていうか…まあ…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:190
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_f56653ee:

    # MC "{i}I’m just not quite sure what I want.{/i}"
    MC "{i}自分が何を望んでいるのか、よくわからないんだ。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:191
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_3fec9308:

    # REGINA "... Well... I’m sure you’ll be good at whatever you end up doing, sweetie."
    REGINA "… まあ… あなたなら何をしてもきっと上手くいくわ、おまえ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:192
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_70857d8b:

    # ERIKA @ talk "Well, this has been fun, but I really must get going."
    ERIKA @ talk "さて、楽しかったけど、そろそろ行かなくちゃ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:194
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_f078974e:

    # REGINA @ sad_talk "So soon? We haven’t seen you in weeks!"
    REGINA @ sad_talk "もう帰るの？数週間も会えてなかったのに!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:195
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_319e2dc2:

    # ERIKA @ sad_talk "I know, I know... But there’s some particularly troubling business that needs my full attention."
    ERIKA @ sad_talk "ああ、ああ…だがな、どうしても俺が全力を注がねばならん厄介な用件があってな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:196
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_36627c23:

    # REGINA @ sad_talk "... Hunting more Dark Mages, I suppose?"
    REGINA @ sad_talk "... もっとダークメイジを狩るつもりだろうか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:197
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_01793ebd:

    # ERIKA @ talk "You know I can’t discuss Inquisitor work."
    ERIKA @ talk "君も知ってるだろう、異端審問官の仕事については話せない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:198
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_4fc03764:

    # REGINA @ sad_talk "If we only talked to them more—"
    REGINA @ sad_talk "もっと話しかければ――"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:199
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_96760879:

    # ERIKA @ sad_talk "We will {i}not{/i} allow tainted magic into Novaras."
    ERIKA @ sad_talk "ノヴァラスに穢れた魔法は{i}決して{/i}受け入れません。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:200
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_ab53317b:

    # REGINA @ talk "But times have changed! Our survival depends on cooperation now, not more division."
    REGINA @ talk "でも時代は変わった!今は分断ではなく協力こそが、我々の生存を左右する。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:201
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_80d8ffc8:

    # ERIKA @ talk "We have enough problems as it is without letting loose dangerous Black Mages across the city."
    ERIKA @ talk "危険な黒魔道士を街に解き放つ必要などない。今でも問題は十分にあるのだから。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:203
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_3b050990:

    # REGINA @ angry_talk "But we need all the mages we can get!"
    REGINA @ angry_talk "でも、できる限りの魔術師が必要なのです!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:205
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_effab067:

    # ERIKA @ angry_talk "It’s the law, and one I am sworn to uphold."
    ERIKA @ angry_talk "法です。私が守ることを誓っている法です。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:206
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_23843033:

    # REGINA @ angry_talk "Urgh... You’re definitely spending too much time with those Inquisitors; you’re starting to sound just like them."
    REGINA @ angry_talk "うっ…絶対に君、あの異端審問官たちと一緒にいる時間が長すぎるんだ。話し方までそっくりになってきてるよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:207
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_b86f4408:

    # ERIKA @ angry_talk "You barely know what you’re talking about!"
    ERIKA @ angry_talk "何も分かってないくせに!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:209
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_b7fa50d6:

    # ERIKA @ talk "I’ve seen with my own eyes some of the horrors from their twisted magic."
    ERIKA @ talk "彼らの歪んだ魔術が生み出す恐怖を、この目で見たことがある。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:211
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_c0c3f0c3:

    # REGINA @ talk "Not all magic is pretty, Erika."
    REGINA @ talk "すべての魔法が美しいわけではないよ、エリカ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:213
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_13a6fd6f:

    # REGINA @ talk "They are born with their magic, you know this."
    REGINA @ talk "彼らは生まれながらに魔法を持つ、ご存知の通り。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:214
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_a140ae77:

    # REGINA @ angry_talk "It’s not a crime to have sympathy for them. "
    REGINA @ angry_talk "彼らに同情することは罪ではない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:215
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_02857159:

    # ERIKA @ talk "No, it’s not, but you know full well that being a sympathiser will lead to Inquisitors like myself investigating you and that will make things very {i}very{/i} difficult."
    ERIKA @ talk "いいえ、違います。しかし、共鳴者が審問官である私のような者に調査されることになり、物事を{i}非常に{/i}困難にするということは、よく分かっているでしょう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:216
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_56987547:

    # ERIKA @ talk "... For {i}both{/i} of us."
    ERIKA @ talk "... {i}二人{/i}にとって。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:217
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_662000c9:

    # REGINA @ angry_talk "Well, I’m sorry Erika but my opinions on the matter—"
    REGINA @ angry_talk "ええ、エリカ、ごめんなさいね、でもこの件に関しての私の個人的な意見は——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:218
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_1b91f8e7:

    # MC angry "That’s enough! Both of you."
    MC angry "もういい!二人とも。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:219
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_cbfd6a46:

    # REGINA @ sad_talk "... Sorry dear, we shouldn’t be squabbling like this on your big day."
    REGINA @ sad_talk "……ごめんね坊や、あなたの大事な日にこんな言い争いをするべきじゃなかったわ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:220
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_502af9bf:

    # ERIKA @ talk "You’re right, now is not the time for debating politics."
    ERIKA @ talk "確かに、今は政治論議をする時ではない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:221
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_5b77c2d3:

    # ERIKA @ talk "Especially matters as important as this."
    ERIKA @ talk "殊にこれほど重要なことは。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:223
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_513aa734:

    # MC "Will you be back when I get home, Erika?"
    MC "帰る頃には帰ってきてる？エリカ"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:224
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_d9bcd695:

    # ERIKA @ talk "No, unfortunately, I’m afraid not..."
    ERIKA @ talk "いえ、残念ながら、恐れ入りますが…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:225
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_5cc55978:

    # MC @ sad "... Oh... Well, I understand, I guess."
    MC @ sad "…ああ…まあ、わかったよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:226
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_205e64ec:

    # ERIKA @ smile_talk "But I promise I will be back soon! And you and I can both go and celebrate properly together then, I swear it."
    ERIKA @ smile_talk "でも、すぐに戻ってくるって約束するよ!その時は二人でちゃんと祝おうね、本当だよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:227
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_e12ad870:

    # MC smile "That would be good..."
    MC smile "それはいいなあ…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:228
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_1b68ba29:

    # MC sad "... I’ve missed you greatly."
    MC sad "…とても寂しかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:229
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_9f47caa8:

    # ERIKA @ smile_talk "And I you."
    ERIKA @ smile_talk "私もあなたが好きです。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:230
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_54bd5cc3:

    # ERIKA @ talk "... Anyhow, I must get going now."
    ERIKA @ talk "それでは、そろそろ行かなくては。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:231
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_cd64f564:

    # REGINA @ talk "... Be safe, dear."
    REGINA @ talk "... 気をつけて、あなた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:234
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_4e1e6187:

    # ERIKA @ talk "And good luck for your results!"
    ERIKA @ talk "それでは、良い結果が出ることを祈っています!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:235
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_59de7aac:

    # ERIKA @ smile_talk "Who knows! Perhaps you will have the honour of serving under me!"
    ERIKA @ smile_talk "さてね!もしかすると、私の下で仕える光栄に浴することになるかもしれないぞ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:237
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_0d681a80:

    # MC "Me and Markus are hoping to celebrate after the results tonight, maybe we will see you out?"
    MC "私とマルクスは今夜の結果を受けて祝う予定なの、一緒にどう？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:238
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_5b93ab95:

    # ERIKA @ talk "Again, unlikely I’m afraid."
    ERIKA @ talk "残念ながら、今回も厳しいでしょう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:239
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_ecfcd90d:

    # REGINA @ talk "{i}*Ahem!*{/i} I hope neither of you are planning to get {i}too{/i} drunk at the tavern this evening!"
    REGINA @ talk "エヘン!今夜二人とも酒場で{i}あまり{/i}酔っ払うつもりじゃないよね？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:240
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_ecc92bc3:

    # MC "... Noooooo."
    MC "…のぉぉぉぉ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:241
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_e987d6e9:

    # ERIKA @ smile_talk "Enjoy yourselves."
    ERIKA @ smile_talk "楽しんで。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:243
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_752c3f2b:

    # "Making her way towards the door, she smiled and waved us farewell."
    "戸口へ歩み寄りながら、彼女は微笑み、手を振った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:244
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_8d770731:

    # ERIKA "Love to you both! I shall return soon!"
    ERIKA "あなたたち二人を愛してる!すぐ戻るからね!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:246
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_f74ba569:

    # MC "Bye, Erika."
    MC "じゃあ、エリカ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:247
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_1ac578c6:

    # REGINA @ talk "Come back soon!"
    REGINA @ talk "またすぐに来てね!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:248
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_1f2326f6:

    # ERIKA "I’ll make sure to buy you a drink!"
    ERIKA "必ずおごるよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:249
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_96e3aaae:

    # "And with that, she closed the door behind her, vanishing from our lives once again."
    "そして彼女は扉を閉め、再び我々の人生から姿を消した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:251
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_b85ff9fb:

    # REGINA @ talk "... Right, you should probably get going as well, you don’t want to be late."
    REGINA @ talk "……そろそろ、君も行った方がいいだろう、遅れちゃうよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:252
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_c63cccfb:

    # REGINA @ talk "Oh, and here by the way, I’ve got a special treat."
    REGINA @ talk "そうそう、ここで特別なごほうびがあるんだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:254
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_84c5d26e:

    # REGINA @ talk "Some grapes for you."
    REGINA @ talk "君にブドウをどうぞ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:256
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_c75261f5:

    # MC "... Are these {i}fresh?{/i} How did you afford them?"
    MC "… これ{i}新鮮なん？{/i} どうやって買えたんだ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:257
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_60a64ecb:

    # REGINA @ lewd_talk "Oh, umm... I perhaps dipped into the savings a little for a special occasion such as this..."
    REGINA @ lewd_talk "えっと…こんな特別な機会ですし、少しだけ貯金を切り崩して…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:259
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_9e610ce5:

    # REGINA @ talk "Oh hush! I did the same for Erika when it was her time."
    REGINA @ talk "やだもう!エリカの時だって同じことしたのに。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:260
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_02dde3ac:

    # MC "You shouldn’t have, it’s too expensive."
    MC "こんな高価なもの、いただくものじゃありません。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:261
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_4dc4a3ba:

    # REGINA @ talk "I won’t hear none of it! It’s your big day!"
    REGINA @ talk "そんなこと言わないで!今日はあなたの大一番だよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:262
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_52311849:

    # REGINA @ talk "Now, go on, shoo!"
    REGINA @ talk "さあ、早くあっち行け!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:263
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_18639b33:

    # REGINA @ talk "And you and Markus be safe!"
    REGINA @ talk "それでは、あなたとマーカスも気をつけてね!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:265
translate ja qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_edc951fa:

    # MC "Be back soon!"
    MC "すぐ戻るね!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:276
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_a6bdbc8f:

    # "There were not many occasions that our walled off capital was able to put aside the bloodshed and horrors of the outside. But every year {i}the Terminus ceremony{/i} was one that found its citizens energised enough to celebrate with real cheer."
    "外の流血と恐怖を忘れられる機会は、この城塞都市に多くはなかった。だが毎年行われる{i}終末祭{/i}だけは、市民たちが心から歓喜に沸く日となっていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:277
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_47f5188c:

    # "Novaras did its best to welcome those who had completed their basic education course and were waiting to be assigned their jobs... {i} for life.{/i}"
    "ノヴァラスは可能な限り歓迎しようとした——基礎教育課程を修了し、仕事の割り当てを待つ者たちを…{i}一生ものの{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:278
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8277ff1c:

    # "Both me and Markus had worked tirelessly to push our performance up to the top of our class, often toiling away with studies deep into the night, trying to gain our position in the palace."
    "マーカスと私の両者は、宮殿での地位を獲得すべく、学年のトップにまで演技力を高めようと倦まず弛まず努力し、しばしば深夜まで学問に励んでいたのである。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:279
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_fd19327d:

    # "We often found ourselves fantasising in the early hours of the morning about how our lives would become a whirlwind of splendour far away from the hunger and drudgery of the {i}normal{/i} population."
    "我々はよく、夜明け前に、{i}普通の{/i}人々の飢えと苦役から遠く離れ、我々の人生が華やかなる嵐となる幻想にふけったものだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:280
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_05d56647:

    # "A favourite topic of ours was, of course, the court ladies we would try to woo, successfully charming our way into their beds each night."
    "我々のお気に入りの話題は、言うまでもなく、あの宮廷の女官たちであった。毎夜、巧みに口説き落としては、彼女たちの閨へ通うことになるのであった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:281
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_31c7bda4:

    # "And the food, OH THE FOOD! We could eat for days till our bellies were fat! No more scrapping over what we’d managed to cobble together. We would eat until our bellies were ready to burst! We often pondered on what it must feel like to be that wealthy."
    "そして食事、あの食事ときたら!腹が満腹になるまで何日でも食べ続けられた!かき集めた僅かな物を奪い合う日々はもう終わり。腹がはち切れるまで食えるんだ!あの金持ちはどんな気分なのか、よく話し合ったものだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:282
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_14f1250e:

    # "Ah... But first we had to reach our Terminus. As I made my way to the ceremony being held at the entrance to the palace, many people greeted me happily along the way."
    "ああ…しかし先ずは、終点に辿り着かねばならなかった。宮殿の入口で行われる儀式へと向かう道中、多くの人々が嬉しそうに私に挨拶をしてきた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:283
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_88534ba0:

    # "Patting me on the back with many ‘Good luck lads!’ and other courteous expressions of well-wishing for me, I basked in admiration, anxious..."
    "「ご武運を、諸君!」などと、次々と私の背中を叩きながら、敬意に満ちた祝福の言葉をかけてくれる彼らに、私はもてはやされ、不安そうに…。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:284
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_2d015ebf:

    # "When I finally made it to the ceremony itself, hundreds of other students like me gathered around and chattered away, their excitement electric."
    "ようやく式場に足を踏み入れると、私と同じように数百人の生徒たちが集まり、張り詰めた熱気の中、賑やかに語り合っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:285
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_68c978d5:

    # "Thousands of commoners gathered to watch the affair from the sides with exuberant smiles on their faces. Confetti was gleefully thrown into the air as we all watched the podium, waiting for the speeches to begin before we’d formally be given our life duties."
    "何千もの民衆が、晴れやかな笑顔でその儀式を脇から見物していた。私たちが演壇を見つめ、生涯の務めを正式に授かる前の演説が始まるのを待つ間、紙吹雪が嬉しそうに空中へと投げ上げられた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:289
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_2098ea1a:

    # MARKUS "There you are!"
    MARKUS "いた!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:290
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_3c4cc504:

    # MC smile "Markus!"
    MC smile "マルクス!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:293
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_93aee4f6:

    # "Markus hurried over towards me, his voice palpable with excitement."
    "マルクスが急いで近づいてくる、声には興奮が滲んでいて。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:294
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_3b27e832:

    # MARKUS "I figured you were still passed out after all the drinking last night!"
    MARKUS "昨日のみすぎでまだ寝てると思ったよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:295
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_3fedadc7:

    # MC "Nah, not me! Already looking forward to tonight!"
    MC "いやあ、俺は違うな!今夜がめっちゃ楽しみだよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:296
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_c0bb39a1:

    # MARKUS "That’s what we like to hear!"
    MARKUS "さあ、そうこなくちゃ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:297
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_6e9b7663:

    # MC "I looked around to see where the rest of our class were, trying to pick out the individual faces of the crowd."
    MC "僕は周りを見回して、クラスの他の連中がどこにいるか、群衆の中から一人一人の顔を探し出そうとした。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:298
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8af6c041:

    # MC "Did your brother make it?"
    MC "君の兄さんは間に合ったのか!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:299
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8651af28:

    # MARKUS "Hm? Oh no, Skallion’s busy down the mines today."
    MARKUS "む？まずい、スカリオンは今日は鉱山で忙しいんだって。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:300
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_eb8b09a6:

    # MC "He couldn’t get the day off, not even for this?"
    MC "休みが取れないのか、こんな時でさえ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:301
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_7c15d6ed:

    # MARKUS "No, unfortunately Demorai attacks have driven up the demand for ore trade, he couldn’t refuse the gold."
    MARKUS "いや、残念ながらデモライの襲撃で鉱石取引の需要が高まり、彼は黄金を断れなかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:302
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_c6423a4b:

    # MC @ sad "Hmm... Still a shame..."
    MC @ sad "うーん…まだ残念だな…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:303
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_eb52465c:

    # MARKUS "Ha! Don’t worry too much, he’s promised us both a barrel of ale to celebrate once he gets back!"
    MARKUS "はっ!　くよくよするなよ、あいつが戻ったらご祝杯にエールを一樽約束してくれたんだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:304
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_3d75881d:

    # MC "No way! Almost glad he’s not here now!"
    MC "まさか!いなくてよかった!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:305
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_fe4f417e:

    # MARKUS "Uh-huh! Think of the girls we can entice over with that!"
    MARKUS "うんうん!　そうすれば、どんな女の子もおびき寄せられるわ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:306
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_97891779:

    # MC "Heh, especially once we have our fancy palace uniforms! We’ll be rolling in—"
    MC "へっ、特に宮殿の制服を着ればね!贅沢三昧さ——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:307
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_73863d95:

    # "Suddenly, a cute high-pitched voice called out from between the chattering waves of happy crowd. A hand waved desperately, trying to grab my attention."
    "突然、陽気な人々のざわめきの波の中から、かわいい甲高い声が響いた。私の注意を引こうと、必死に手が振られていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:310
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_26ce5014:

    # MARKUS "Oooh! Your future wife is here!"
    MARKUS "おお!あなたの将来の妻が来たよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:312
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_6928aee0:

    # MC smile "At least I won’t be dying alone like you!"
    MC smile "せめて私は、あんたみたいに一人で死ぬことはないよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:313
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8aac5536:

    # MARKUS "Alright heartthrob, she’s been chasing you down since she first laid eyes on you!"
    MARKUS "よし、君が一目惚れしたあの子が、君を追いかけ回してるんだからね"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:314
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_d205f56c:

    # "I rolled my eyes at Markus’ comment as he chuckled to himself, but he was right, Adara would do anything in her power to spend time with me in and out of class."
    "マーカスのコメントに、あきれたように目を回した。彼は一人でくすくす笑っていたが、その通りだった。アダラは、授業中でも休み時間でも、どんな手を使っても私と時間を過ごそうとするんだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:315
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_109c5624:

    # "Not that I didn’t like her, she was very cute... {i}but{/i} our studies took up so much time that socialising was a difficult thing to do, and near enough impossible if you aimed as high as me and Markus."
    "彼女のことが嫌いではなかった、むしろとても可愛かった…{i}けど{/i}、勉強が忙しすぎて人付き合いをするのは難しく、僕やマーカスみたいに高みを目指すなら、ほぼ不可能に近かった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:316
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_34dee6d3:

    # "Adara finally managed to break through the throngs of people to reach us."
    "アダラはようやく人混みをかき分けて、私たちのもとにたどり着いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:317
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8c7b8a5b:

    # ADARA @ talk "{i}*Huff*{/i} Hey, both!"
    ADARA @ talk "{i}*ふう* ねえ、二人とも!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:318
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_57f95235:

    # MARKUS "Did you {i}run{/i} all the way here?"
    MARKUS "ここまで{i}走って{/i}来たの？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:319
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_5fa584c7:

    # ADARA @ talk "Huh?! Uh... N-No..."
    ADARA @ talk "えっ？!あっ…う…ううん…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:320
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_20cb3f80:

    # MC smile "You overslept again, didn’t you?"
    MC smile "また寝坊したね。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:321
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_eb3843b8:

    # "Adara became flustered as I caught onto her, but I knew her like the back of my hand."
    "私に見透かされて、アダラは慌てたが、彼女のことは手のひらを読むようによく知っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:322
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_52f870a7:

    # ADARA @ angry "N-No!"
    ADARA @ angry "や、やだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:323
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_de32d813:

    # "Markus and I shared a glance and chuckled."
    "マルクスと私は目を合わせて、ふたりでくすくす笑った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:324
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_decd3ea5:

    # ADARA @ talk "H-Hey! I DID NOT oversleep, guys!"
    ADARA @ talk "は、はぁい! 寝坊なんてしてないんだからね、みんな!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:326
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_a0712279:

    # MC "We aren’t—"
    MC "私たちは違う—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:328
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_b3b10d33:

    # ADARA @ shock "W-What?! We are so not—"
    ADARA @ shock "えっ、なに？!　そんなわけない—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:329
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_73abf0ec:

    # MARKUS "Yeah, yeah!"
    MARKUS "はあ、はあ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:331
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_55c6dd2b:

    # "Markus left, fighting his way through the crowds as he called out to some classmates."
    "マルクスは去っていった、人混みを押し分けながら何人かの級友に声をかけつつ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:333
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_799ba0b6:

    # ADARA @ talk "He’s so infuriating when he talks about us like that!"
    ADARA @ talk "あの人、そんな風に私たちのこと言うと本当に頭にくるよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:334
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_bcfa5447:

    # ADARA @ talk "... Right?"
    ADARA @ talk "…よね？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:338
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_58904013:

    # ADARA @ talk "Hmm? Oh! Umm, maybe? It’s... It’s not really my thing..."
    ADARA @ talk "えっ？あ!えっと…そうかも？私のタイプじゃないから…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:339
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_ba52742b:

    # MC "Ah, I see..."
    MC "ああ、なるほど…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:340
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_2726822b:

    # ADARA @ talk "... But... if {i}you’re{/i} going, I guess I could come for a bit."
    ADARA @ talk "…でも…{i}あんた{/i}が行くなら、ちょっとぐらいなら付き合ってもいいか。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:343
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_d4caf7ad:

    # ADARA @ shock "E-Eh?!"
    ADARA @ shock "え、えっ？!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:344
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_0d0b8d7f:

    # ADARA @ talk "S-Stop saying such weird things!"
    ADARA @ talk "そ、そんな変態なこと言うなよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:345
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_2876ee01:

    # ADARA @ talk "{i}Idiot!{/i}"
    ADARA @ talk "{i}馬鹿!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:347
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_157c6b76:

    # ADARA @ talk "Oh... Right..."
    ADARA @ talk "ああ…そうか…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:352
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_045c8eab:

    # "Interrupting us, the crowd suddenly roared with cheers as Queen Adelaide and King Mesamor came to the podium, smiling and waving down at us in their luxurious royal wear, their arrogant son absent as usual."
    "我々の会話を遮るように、群衆の歓声が突然わき上がった。アデレード王妃とメサモル国王が演壇に現れ、豪華な王族衣装に身を包み、上機嫌で微笑みながら我々に手を振っていた。あの傲慢な息子は相変わらず姿を見せなかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:353
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_1394dc9c:

    # "The Queen was a beauty, there was no doubt about that. Many a crude joke had been told in private amongst boys wishing they were her personal squires, helping to {i}tend to ALL her needs...{/i}"
    "女王は美貌の持ち主で、それには疑いの余地がなかった。多くの下品な冗談が、少年たちの間でこっそりと語られていた。彼らは自分が女王の個人的な従者だったらと願いながら、{i}彼女のすべての用事を「世話」できたら…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:354
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_0ce3c759:

    # "She was a woman who was respected, but she was not loved."
    "彼女は尊敬されていたが、愛されていなかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:355
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_65b84426:

    # "She did send money towards charity endeavours such as orphanages, but rarely wanted to be seen by the common people unless some official decorum demanded it, such as this occasion."
    "彼女は孤児院など慈善事業への寄付は行っていたが、一般民衆の前に姿を見せることは稀で、今回のように公式の儀礼が要求される場合に限られていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:356
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_6590881b:

    # "Thankfully, she did not rule alone."
    "幸いなことに、彼女は一人で統治していたわけではなかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:357
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_0eb08be8:

    # "The King smiled, but his eyes were heavy, after all, it had been several years since he’d been deposed in 1156 by our ‘Emperor,’ and he now occupied only a figurehead position..."
    "王は微笑んだが、その目は重たげだった。1156年に我らの『天皇』によって退位させられてから数年が経ち、今や彼は名ばかりの地位を占めるのみだった……"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:358
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_304f39b7:

    # "{i}But...{/i} despite this, he remained popular amongst the people, a symbol of the will to keep persevering in the fight against the Demorai... even though he now had only a shadow of his former power."
    "{i}しかし…{/i}それでも彼は人々の人気を失わず、デモライとの戦いで諦めない意志の象徴であり続けた…かつての力の影すら残っていないのに。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:359
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_5c0c262d:

    # "{i}Ironic,{/i} given that at the time the people would have had his head on a stick for his handling of the war."
    "{i}皮肉なことだ{/i}、当時は戦争の対応を巡って民衆が彼を晒し者にしていたというのに。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:360
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_206a036b:

    # "I guess that time allows people to romanticise anyone if enough of it goes by."
    "たぶん、十分な時間が経てば、誰でも浪漫的に見えるようになるってことなんだろう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:361
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_b2159af0:

    # ADARA @ talk "Where’s the Princess? Can you see her?"
    ADARA @ talk "姫はどこ？
見える？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:362
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_cd8ebdee:

    # MC "No, is she—"
    MC "いや、彼女はか―"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:363
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_06b7173d:

    # RANDOM_MAN "LOOK! IT’S THE PRINCESS!"
    RANDOM_MAN "見て!お姫様だ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:368
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_9988f46e:

    # "Nervously stepping out onto the balcony, the beautiful Princess Cecilia smiled and waved at the crowds timidly. Adored and loved by all, {i}the realm's Princess{/i} was renowned for her charitable and kind nature."
    "おずおずとバルコニーに出てきた美しいセシリア姫は、はにかみながら微笑んで人々に手を振った。誰からも愛され慕われる{i}王国の姫君{/i}は、その慈悲深く優しい性格で広く知られていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:369
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_120bafa6:

    # "I don’t think there was a single hot-blooded male that hadn’t dreamed about her at some point or another, me and Markus included."
    "熱血漢なら一度は彼女に夢中になったことのない者はいなかっただろう、俺とマーカスも例外じゃなかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:370
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_2eff982e:

    # "I must have had a thousand dreams where I climbed into her chambers through a window and we stole away together and—"
    "何千回も夢に見た。窓から彼女の部屋に忍び込んで、二人で一緒に駆け落ちする夢を──"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:376
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_9441240c:

    # "Markus reappeared from the crowd and playfully grabbed my shoulder, squeezing it tightly as he leaned over to speak in my ear."
    "マルクスは群衆の中から再び現れ、ふざけるように私の肩を掴むと、ぎゅっと握りしめながら身を乗り出し、耳元に口を寄せて話し始めた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:377
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_cd3b5f70:

    # MARKUS "So, when we get to the Royal Court, which one you chasing?"
    MARKUS "じゃあ、王宮に着いたら、どの子にアタックするの？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:378
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_10a2efba:

    # ADARA @ shock "Markus!"
    ADARA @ shock "マーカス!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:380
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_7b6a0436:

    # ADARA @ angry "The royal family is our oldest and most respected institute!"
    ADARA @ angry "王室は最も古く、最も尊ばれている制度なのです!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:381
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_7e78cf25:

    # MARKUS "The royal family is comprised of women prettier than the most expensive whores in the land!"
    MARKUS "由緒正しい王家は、この国で最も高級な娼婦よりも美しい女性ばかりだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:382
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_91eb0004:

    # ADARA @ angry "{i}*Groans!*{/i}"
    ADARA @ angry "{i}*うっ*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:383
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_cce102bc:

    # ADARA @ angry "You’re both terrible."
    ADARA @ angry "二人とも最低だ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:384
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_23ffda91:

    # MARKUS "Oh, you love us really."
    MARKUS "まあ、あなたは本当に私たちを愛してるんでしょう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:385
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_25c2d4a7:

    # ADARA @ angry "Urgh! You do know that when you’re both talking about dividing up women like the spoils of war, it makes me and every other woman want to vomit, right?"
    ADARA @ angry "うっ!　男二人で戦利品みたいに女を分け合う話をされてると、私たち女全員吐き気がするってわかってるよね？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:388
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_7093f258:

    # ADARA @ angry "I-I AM NOT GOING IN ANYONE’S HAREM, THANK YOU!"
    ADARA @ angry "わ、私は誰のハーレムにも入りません、結構です!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:396
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_40660028:

    # MARKUS "Not if I marry her first!"
    MARKUS "先に結婚するのは私だ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:397
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_4d8a2f81:

    # ADARA @ angry "Grrr..."
    ADARA @ angry "ヴ゙゙゙…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:398
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_86d5a848:

    # ADARA @ angry "Can you perverts think of nothing else other than what’s between your legs?"
    ADARA @ angry "エッチ野郎ども、いつも股間のことしか考えてないの？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:399
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_4f3400b3:

    # MARKUS "..."
    MARKUS "……"

