    MC "……"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:401
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_6b2edec9:

    # MARKUS "Nope."
    MARKUS "いや。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:402
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_a3a7354e:

    # MC "Definitely not."
    MC "絶対に違う。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:403
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_af70856c:

    # ADARA @ talk "{i}*Sigh*{/i} You two are hopeless!"
    ADARA @ talk "{i}はあ…{/i}しょうがないなあ、二人とも!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:406
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_d8cfb0e0:

    # ADARA @ shock "{i}You...{/i} You pervert!"
    ADARA @ shock "{i}あんた…{/i}この変態!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:407
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_d4a06244:

    # MARKUS "{i}*Whistles*{/i} Well... you always did have a thing for older women."
    MARKUS "{i}*ピューピュー*{/i} まあ…お前、昔から年上の女性が好きだったよな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:408
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_540c64f4:

    # ADARA @ angry "S-Shut up!"
    ADARA @ angry "く、黙れ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:409
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_64a9ae3b:

    # MARKUS "Don’t worry, Adara! All you need to do is wait a couple years and he’ll—"
    MARKUS "大丈夫だよ、アダラ! 2年ほど経てば彼もきっと——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:410
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_158431c5:

    # ADARA @ angry "Finish that sentence if you want to die."
    ADARA @ angry "死にたいなら、その文を完成させろ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:411
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_4f3400b3_1:

    # MARKUS "..."
    MARKUS "……"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:412
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_2933ea30:

    # ADARA "..."
    ADARA "……"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:413
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_19f71dec:

    # MARKUS "WAIT A COUPLE YEARS AND HE’LL BE INTERESTED IN THAT WRINKLY—"
    MARKUS "数年后、彼はシワシワのあれに興味を持つだろうー"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:415
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_3ad6dfd4:

    # "Adara slapped Markus across his face, leaving a stinging red mark in its wake." with flash
    "アダラはマーカスの顔を平手打ちにし、ヒリヒリするような赤い痕を残した。" with flash

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:416
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_f8d171b5:

    # MARKUS "Ow! Fuck! That hurt!"
    MARKUS "痛っ!クソ!痛い!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:417
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_10b26e90:

    # ADARA @ angry "Hmph! Teach you to be so crude..."
    ADARA @ angry "ふんっ!思い知らせてやる…失礼な!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:420
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_e3aa6700:

    # ADARA @ shock "S-Shut up!"
    ADARA @ shock "ち、ちがう!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:421
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_762dcae9:

    # ADARA @ angry "Someone has to stop you idiots getting your heads put on sticks!"
    ADARA @ angry "誰かがてめえらの首を串刺しにされないよう止めてやらねえと!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:430
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_ea8481dd:

    # "The murmurs of the crowd died down suddenly; the sense of festivities soon became eerie silence."
    "群衆のざわめきが突然途絶え、祝祭の気配は瞬く間に不気味な静寂と変わった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:431
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_33948c6a:

    # "All heads turned to see our ‘Emperor’, Kendrick Alcott, as he slowly made his way towards the podium, donned in his thick golden armour that clanged with every step, his elite guard marching behind."
    "全ての視線が、私たちの『皇帝様』、ケンドリック・アルコットへと集まった。分厚い黄金の鎧を纏い、一歩ごとにガシャガシャと音を立てながら、ゆっくりと演説壇へと向かう彼の背後を、精鋭の衛兵たちが行進している。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:432
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_842aed12:

    # "There were murmurs and whispers amongst the crowd, Alcott was not popular by any metric, but he was respected, and above all... {i}feared.{/i}"
    "群衆の中には囁きや私語が飛び交った。
アルコットはどの基準でも人気があるわけではなかったが、尊敬はされており、そして何より…{i}怖れられていた。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:435
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8ff1bc91:

    # ALCOTT "... Today is a special day for this kingdom."
    ALCOTT "……この王国には、今日は特別な日です。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:436
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_1e39f10a:

    # ALCOTT @ smile "It has been fourteen years since our war with the Demorai began. Fourteen years of sacrifices..."
    ALCOTT @ smile "我々とデモライとの戦争が始まってから十四年が経つ。十四年もの犠牲が…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:437
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_4872ab72:

    # ALCOTT " Fourteen years of losses too great to put into words."
    ALCOTT "十四年間、言葉にできないほど大きなものを失った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:438
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8be50508:

    # ALCOTT "Each of us has lost someone in this conflict, but the battle continues even now, with many of our kin away from home helping to secure and restore our once great kingdom!"
    ALCOTT "この戦いで誰かを失いながらも、戦いは今も尚続いている。我らが多くの同胞は、故郷を離れ、かつて偉大だった我が王国の復興と防衛に尽力しているのだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:439
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_5dd048a4:

    # ALCOTT "The road ahead is hard, it is brutal... {i}and it is bloody.{/i} "
    ALCOTT "前の道は困難で、冷酷だ…{i}そして血塗られている。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:440
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_a11fa683:

    # ALCOTT "But today is a day of new hope!"
    ALCOTT "今日は新たな希望の日だ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:441
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_a9388680:

    # ALCOTT "A day for a new generation to lead the fight!"
    ALCOTT "新世代が戦いを導く日!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:442
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_a1dfe190:

    # ALCOTT "And we WILL be victorious in this conflict!"
    ALCOTT "そして、我々はこの戦いに必ず勝利するのだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:443
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_7395f2c2:

    # ALCOTT "We will survive and we WILL thrive once again!"
    ALCOTT "我々は生き延び、そして必ずや再び栄華を極めるのだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:444
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_b5393478:

    # ALCOTT "And most importantly, we will do it for them!"
    ALCOTT "何よりも、我々は彼らのためにやる!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:445
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_fdf784a9:

    # ALCOTT "We will build the world they fought for, the world they wanted you to have!"
    ALCOTT "彼らが戦った世界を、彼らがあなたに託した世界を、我々が築くのだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:446
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_5b213438:

    # ALCOTT "To those of you now bearing the responsibility of helping us restore this kingdom to its former glory, whether soldier or baker, blacksmith or humble street sweeper..."
    ALCOTT "我らと共に、この王国をかつての栄光へと導く責務を負う者たちへ。兵士であれ、パン職人であれ、鍛冶屋であれ、慎ましき街の掃除役であれ…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:447
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_9a4b160d:

    # ALCOTT "I salute you!"
    ALCOTT "ごきげんよう!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:448
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_d9a239d2:

    # ALCOTT "HEIL!"
    ALCOTT "ハイル!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:451
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_4834d82f:

    # CROWD "HEIL EMPEROR ALCOTT! HEIL THE NEW ALDERIAN EMPIRE!"
    CROWD "万歳、アルコット皇帝陛下!万歳、新アルデリアン帝国!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:452
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_debab30d:

    # ALCOTT "Go now and do your Emperor proud! Do your country proud and do yourselves proud!"
    ALCOTT "行け、皇帝に誇りを! 国に誇りを! そして己自身に誇りを!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:459
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_bbe6fc24:

    # "And with that, Emperor Alcott descended from the podium, escorted back towards the fort from which he ruled and administered his government duties from."
    "そして、アルコット皇帝は演壇から降り、護衛に伴われて、統治と政務を執り行う城塞へと戻っていく。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:460
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_47d3e974:

    # "As he passed by me, he looked at me for a moment, with the coldest eyes I had ever seen, as though his gaze could cut through and freeze my very soul."
    "通り過ぎる際、彼は一瞬わたしを見た。今まで見た中で最も冷たい目で、まるでその視線がわたしの魂さえも切り裂き凍てつかせるかのように。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:465
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_a8edd937:

    # ADARA @ talk "He’s so scary..."
    ADARA @ talk "彼、すごくこわいよ…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:466
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_afc8cc1f:

    # MC "Yeah..."
    MC "うん…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:467
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_49080373:

    # MARKUS "He might be scary, but without him this city would have fallen long ago."
    MARKUS "彼は怖いかもしれないが、彼なしではこの街はとうの昔に陥落していただろう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:468
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_525dee60:

    # MARKUS "We need more leaders like him. Leaders who will do what has to be done."
    MARKUS "彼のような指導者が必要だ。
やるべきことを成し遂げる指導者が。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:469
