    ADARA @ talk "うーん、あまり自信がありません……あんなふうに王様を追放した後では……"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:470
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_db5a5efc:

    # MARKUS "Alcott led troops and repelled The Great Invasion from taking Novaras while the King continued to squander more troops lives pointlessly."
    MARKUS "アルコットは軍を率い、ノヴァラスを占領しようとする大侵略を撃退した一方で、王は相変わらず無意味に兵士たちの命を浪費し続けていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:471
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_ae457738:

    # MARKUS "If it wasn’t for him, this place would have fallen in 1152."
