translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_757e00c2:

    # "The woman shuffled through the envelopes stamped down with the red wax seal of the Royal Court, and after finding mine, handed it over to me which I snatched greedily from her hands."
    "女は宮廷の赤い封蝋の紋章が押された封筒をめくっていき、私のものを見つけると手渡してきたので、私は貪るように彼女の手から奪い取った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:501
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_70c7cba8:

    # WOMAN "Good luck!"
    WOMAN "頑張って!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:502
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_19f340fd:

    # MC "Thank you!"
    MC "ありがとうございます"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:503
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_12fca38c:

    # "This is it! This is my destiny in my hands!"
    "これだ!我が手中に我が運命!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:504
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_403df7de:

    # "All these years of work are finally going to pay off!"
    "長年の努力が、ついに実を結ぶんだ!"

