    # MC "This! This has to be a mistake! I can’t be in the Scouts! I’m not—"
    MC "これ!　これは間違いに違いない!　私がスカウト軍団に入れるわけがない!　だって私は…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:534
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_4f67789a:

    # WOMAN "If it’s got your name on the front and that’s what’s written, then I’m afraid you are, sir."
