translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_25dc304d:

    # "The guard shoved me back sharply, making me stumble as I fell on my ass, tears springing behind my eyes as I muttered to myself."
    "衛兵は私を強く押し返し、私は尻餅をついてよろめいた。目尻が熱くなりながら、私は独り言のように呟いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:538
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_52378a4f:

    # MC "No... {i}No this can’t be!{/i}"
    MC "違う…{i}まさかそんな!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:539
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_f20c8d0d:

    # MC "I can’t... {i}This...{/i}... This is a nightmare!"
    MC "もうだめ… {i}これ…{/i}… これは悪夢だ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:540
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_fd8e9f7a:

    # MC "{i}It can’t be real!{/i}"
    MC "{i}そんなバカな!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:546
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_903a92c1:

    # "Dazed, I walked the streets aimlessly for what seemed like an eternity, until I found myself in the housing district."
    "呆然と、私は当てもなく街を歩き続け、気がつくと住宅街にたどり着いていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:547
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_62f22980:

    # "I dragged myself over to Markus’ home, dejected, destroyed... {i}broken.{/i}"
    "がっくりと肩を落とし、打ちひしがれ…{i}壊れ果てた{/i}私は、マーカスの家まで引きずるように向かった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:554
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_0c816036:

    # "I found him slouched against the wall by his front door, a solemn look on his face as he turned to me, still holding his own sheet in his hands."
    "彼を私は見つけた、自宅のドア横の壁にもたれ、手にはまだ自分のシートを握りしめたまま、私に向き直った彼の顔には重苦しい表情が浮かんでいた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:555
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_25c532ca:

    # MARKUS "... I’ve been placed in the Scouts."
    MARKUS "… 俺は偵察隊に配属された。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:556
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_d92e9348:

    # "He said with a lifeless look in his eyes, my eyes widened in shock."
    "彼は虚ろな目で言った、私は驚きで目を見開いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:557
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_dd0c95fc:

    # MC "... Y-You’re..."
    MC "…あ…あんた…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:558
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_06928b06:

    # MARKUS "Yes."
    MARKUS "はい。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:559
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_569f4dc6:

    # "I gulped hard, nodding."
    "ゴクリと唾を飲み込み、私は頷いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:560
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_55c52802:

    # MC "... {i}Me too.{/i}"
    MC "{i}私も。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:561
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_e70ab855:

    # "Markus’ mouth hung open in shock, all our dreams and hopes... just like that, {i}gone.{/i}"
    "マルクスは衝撃で口をぽかんと開けた。私たちの夢も希望も…あっけなく{i}消えてしまった。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:562
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_01020745:

    # MARKUS "... No, you mean—"
    MARKUS "…いや…そうじゃなくて"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:563
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_605f37ff:

    # MC "... Heh... Well, looks like we’re still stuck together... Just..."
    MC "…へっ…どうやら、まだ俺たちはくっついてるみたいだな…ただ…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:564
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_0f584615:

    # MC "Not in the way we hoped."
    MC "望んだようにはならなかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:565
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_66cfca50:

    # MARKUS "... Yeah..."
    MARKUS "そうだ…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:566
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_57bce272:

    # MARKUS "Instead of eating well and wooing court ladies together."
    MARKUS "美食を共にし、宮廷の女官を口説く代わりに。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:567
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_063f8be5:

    # MARKUS "{i}We’re gonna fucking die...{/i}"
    MARKUS "{i}マジで死ぬぜ…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:568
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_d58e0d46:

    # MC "We don’t know that! Come on, we’ll—"
    MC "「そんなの知らないよ!ねえ、私たちが——」"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:570
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_555ad1e1:

    # MARKUS "Frankly, I’m half tempted just to get a rope and save myself the agony of dying by {i}their{/i} hands."
    MARKUS "正直、本気で考えているくらいだ。ロープを手に入れて、奴らの手に掛かる苦しみから逃れるためなら。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:571
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_1ebe35b7:

    # MC "Don’t joke about that!"
    MC "冗談はよせ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:572
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_80e3fd99:

    # MARKUS "Why not? We’re fucked anyway."
    MARKUS "どうしてダメだ？　どうせ俺たちは詰んでるんだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:573
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_ed1242e8:

    # MC "Well, you’ll definitely be fucked if you do that!"
    MC "そりゃ、絶対やばいことになるよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:574
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_e160c276:

    # MC "And you’ll be fucking me over! I need someone to have my back out {i}there!{/i}"
    MC "それに俺に足を引っ張る気かよ!あの場所で俺を{i}頼りになる奴が{/i}必要なんだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:576
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_f699c54d:

    # MC "Don’t give me that shit! We’ve stuck together since we were kids, we’re gonna stick together and get through this now! Understand?"
    MC "ふざけるな!子供の頃からずっと一緒だったんだ、これからも一緒に乗り越えるんだ!わかったな!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:577
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_d42ade9c:

    # "Markus sighed deeply, not really believing me but playing along anyway."
    "マルクスは深くため息をつき、本当には信じていないだろうが、付き合ってくれた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:578
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_571fda6d:

    # MARKUS "... Yeah... We’ll make it out."
    MARKUS "…ああ…きっと抜け出せる"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:579
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_72a150fc:

    # MARKUS "{i}*Sigh*{/i} Look, I don’t know about you, but for my last goddamn night of freedom I’m gonna head down the Pleasure District, you coming?"
    MARKUS "{i}*はあ*{/i}　なあ、俺は知らねえけどさ、せっかくの最後の自由な夜なんだ、娯楽区に行ってくるぞ。お前も来るか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:580
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_27a83521:

    # "My eyes lit up in surprise."
    "目が驚きで輝いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:581
translate ja qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8009daa6:

